WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.563
A complex system can be hard to read in one diagram.

00:00:03.723 --> 00:00:05.195
Keep the overview clear.

00:00:05.355 --> 00:00:07.979
Open a component when you need more detail.

00:00:08.139 --> 00:00:11.360
This is the Transformer example in Archify Labs.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:15.531
Select Transformer Layer and open its internal architecture.

00:00:15.691 --> 00:00:18.422
The child expands below the main diagram.

00:00:18.582 --> 00:00:21.782
Its local components have their own Semantic Passport.

00:00:21.942 --> 00:00:24.353
The Export menu offers two targets.

00:00:24.513 --> 00:00:27.009
Main diagram exports the overview.

00:00:27.169 --> 00:00:30.881
Current subarchitecture exports only the open child.

00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:34.667
This child SVG contains seven local components.

00:00:34.827 --> 00:00:37.025
The two exports stay independent.

00:00:37.185 --> 00:00:39.126
Use Back to model to return.

00:00:39.286 --> 00:00:42.998
The page restores your scroll position and parent selection.

00:00:43.158 --> 00:00:44.972
Larger children can scroll.

00:00:45.132 --> 00:00:48.033
The main diagram keeps its original behavior.

00:00:48.193 --> 00:00:51.478
The BAGEL example follows the official inference code.

00:00:51.638 --> 00:00:56.310
Open context assembly to inspect text, vision, and VAE paths.

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:00.886
Open the MoT layer to see attention and separate feed-forward paths.

00:01:01.046 --> 00:01:04.268
Source links point to a fixed repository revision.

00:01:04.428 --> 00:01:07.329
The Lance example follows a dataset query.

00:01:07.489 --> 00:01:10.135
Open the scanner to inspect its query plan.

00:01:10.295 --> 00:01:13.004
Some stages depend on the query options.

00:01:13.164 --> 00:01:15.169
Then open the Arrow stream bridge.

00:01:15.329 --> 00:01:17.420
See how Rust batches reach Python.

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:20.247
These views are optional additions in Labs.

00:01:20.407 --> 00:01:24.204
Each child stays one level deep with up to twelve components.

00:01:24.364 --> 00:01:27.457
Try Transformer, BAGEL, and Lance in the gallery.

00:01:27.617 --> 00:01:30.455
Bring a real diagram and share what you find.
